WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:10.820
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:03.310 --> 00:07.070
While headed for Eisetsu City with the aim of getting the eighth badge,

00:07.720 --> 00:12.780
Satoshi and his friends decide to camp outside to watch the Shishikonids on the night of the new moon.

00:14.300 --> 00:17.070
I want the shooting stars to come already...

00:18.240 --> 00:19.800
Today is new moon,

00:20.250 --> 00:22.540
so I am sure they will look pretty.

00:23.500 --> 00:25.160
We've got to make a wish!

00:25.680 --> 00:26.490
What do you mean?

00:26.750 --> 00:30.620
If you make a wish to a shooting star, it's said that it will come true.

00:31.130 --> 00:33.230
Let's make lots of wishes, then!

00:33.770 --> 00:34.990
All right, me too!

00:40.080 --> 00:41.220
Hey, how much longer?

00:42.650 --> 00:44.010
I am sure they will come soon.

00:46.860 --> 00:48.380
Did you see that shooting star?

00:48.380 --> 00:49.270
What, where?

00:49.550 --> 00:49.930
No way!

00:49.930 --> 00:51.820
Oh shoot, I missed it.

00:51.820 --> 00:53.400
The next one is bound to show up soon.

00:57.640 --> 00:58.030
Whoa!

00:58.520 --> 01:00.290
Wish, wish!

01:00.760 --> 01:04.300
Uh... May I meet many strong Trainers.

01:04.300 --> 01:06.880
May I obtain my third Key at the Tripokalon.

01:06.880 --> 01:09.680
May I become a Trainer soon!

01:09.680 --> 01:11.740
Uh, also... Also...

01:11.740 --> 01:15.820
May my brother get a cute and responsible wife, s'il-vous-plaît!

01:15.820 --> 01:17.020
Eureka?!

01:17.020 --> 01:19.100
Bro, hurry up and make a wish!

01:19.100 --> 01:21.830
U-Uh... Well... Uhm...

01:21.830 --> 01:23.340
May everyone's wish come true!

01:25.930 --> 01:27.190
What's that? How boring...

01:28.060 --> 01:30.000
What?!

01:33.310 --> 01:39.030
Pikachu Dreams of Squishy!

01:43.040 --> 01:52.900
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

01:43.040 --> 01:52.900
Z

01:43.240 --> 01:44.430
Goodnight.

01:45.180 --> 01:46.790
Hm? What's that?

01:47.070 --> 01:48.410
I have made this.

01:48.410 --> 01:52.360
This is the alarm clock "Shut up, Shuzo-kun", which is sure to wake us up.

01:52.360 --> 01:54.840
Now we will be able to wake up on time.

01:55.160 --> 01:57.680
Oh, I'm looking forward to that.

02:32.920 --> 02:36.090
Geez, they're so loud I can't sleep.

02:36.710 --> 02:38.520
All right, this should do...

02:39.710 --> 02:41.670
One Merriep,

02:43.370 --> 02:45.340
two Merriep,

02:46.030 --> 02:47.990
three Merriep,

02:48.590 --> 02:51.070
four Merriep...

02:51.590 --> 02:52.830
Five...

03:36.200 --> 03:38.070
I'm full already.

03:50.830 --> 03:53.790
10,106 Merriep,

03:53.790 --> 03:55.900
10,107 Merriep,

03:56.250 --> 03:58.570
10,108 Merriep...

04:02.420 --> 04:04.300
You're heavy!

04:08.550 --> 04:10.310
It was a dream...

04:10.780 --> 04:13.660
I was about to get crushed by those Merriep!

04:14.570 --> 04:17.900
Uh... Now I'm kinda thirsty...

04:19.790 --> 04:22.520
Wasn't there a river in that direction?

04:32.200 --> 04:34.120
Pikachu!

04:37.630 --> 04:39.470
Good morning!

04:41.020 --> 04:43.130
Ah, I be thirsty.

04:43.130 --> 04:43.930
Me too.

04:46.120 --> 04:47.340
What are you talking about?

04:47.610 --> 04:49.300
It's me! See?

04:50.920 --> 04:53.630
What be with you, Pikachu? Have you perchance contracted fever?

04:53.950 --> 04:55.630
You be lacking training!

04:58.490 --> 04:59.820
What are you talking about?

05:00.170 --> 05:02.030
We've always talked.

05:04.950 --> 05:07.570
Halt this nonsense.

05:07.990 --> 05:09.210
Pikachu is so strange.

05:09.660 --> 05:11.500
It must be half-asleep still.

05:20.710 --> 05:23.340
What? What's going on?

05:23.630 --> 05:25.840
This is an emergency!

05:47.030 --> 05:48.910
This is terrible!

05:49.070 --> 05:52.410
Musashi, Kojiro! Wake up!

05:57.530 --> 06:01.260
The brats' Pokémon have evolved and de-evolved...

06:01.260 --> 06:04.380
...and - you won't believe it - they're speaking human language!

06:09.770 --> 06:12.140
This isn't the time to be joking around!

06:20.040 --> 06:23.320
Now even Musashi and Kojiro are acting weird!

06:44.620 --> 06:46.570
I'm normal!

06:48.840 --> 06:51.230
You're also the same Pikachu as always.

06:52.630 --> 06:54.940
It's everyone else that's acting strange!

06:59.950 --> 07:01.060
What's up?

07:01.740 --> 07:05.070
The lad's Pikachu and the Monster Cat of the Rocket Gang.

07:06.250 --> 07:07.690
This guy can speak?

07:08.200 --> 07:10.450
What are you astonished about?

07:10.790 --> 07:12.940
Are you not speaking yourself?

07:13.100 --> 07:15.080
I've been able to for a long time now.

07:20.870 --> 07:22.540
What's that?

07:23.020 --> 07:24.790
We are being followed by that.

07:26.830 --> 07:28.070
Help us!

07:29.660 --> 07:30.600
Anyway, run!

07:37.270 --> 07:38.860
Do as it says!

07:42.570 --> 07:44.120
It's following us!

07:44.350 --> 07:46.860
That's right! Let's hand the blob over to it!

07:51.110 --> 07:52.380
Faster!

08:01.230 --> 08:02.500
Oh no!

08:02.870 --> 08:04.310
It's a dead end!

08:04.310 --> 08:05.740
Take this path!

08:10.430 --> 08:14.100
I don't like getting my toe beans wet...

08:18.830 --> 08:21.520
Pikachu, don't leave me!

08:32.680 --> 08:34.330
Hm. You did well.

08:34.820 --> 08:38.910
We praise the lad's Pikachu and the Rocket Gang's Monster Cat.

08:42.300 --> 08:44.620
Do you know what that was just now?

08:45.130 --> 08:47.470
It is attempting to capture us.

08:47.470 --> 08:51.560
I got that part. I meant to ask <i>why</i> it's after you.

08:51.560 --> 08:52.920
That <i>we</i> do not know either.

08:53.580 --> 08:58.140
However... There is no doubt something bad is about to happen.

09:00.280 --> 09:03.140
You're talking gibberish.

09:04.410 --> 09:05.820
We wish for you...

09:06.710 --> 09:08.670
...to take us home!

09:09.300 --> 09:11.790
What, home? Why?

09:11.790 --> 09:14.330
Our powers have not returned to us yet.

09:14.990 --> 09:19.200
If something were to happen before they do so, Kalos will become disordered.

09:19.800 --> 09:22.140
I have absolutely no clue what you mean.

09:23.720 --> 09:25.770
Very well. Touch us.

09:50.890 --> 09:51.850
Pikachu!

09:51.850 --> 09:53.420
Wh-What's wrong?

09:55.550 --> 09:56.220
Are you all right?

09:57.270 --> 09:59.550
Maybe it had a nightmare?

10:05.260 --> 10:07.000
What's the matter, Pikachu?

10:08.470 --> 10:09.000
Huh?

10:09.670 --> 10:10.730
Squishy is gone!

10:11.290 --> 10:13.740
Dedenne, do you know where Squishy went?

10:19.030 --> 10:21.140
Hey, Pikachu! Where are you going?

10:21.870 --> 10:23.550
It must've gone to look for Squishy.

10:24.200 --> 10:25.690
Let us search for it as well.

10:25.900 --> 10:26.620
Yeah!

10:36.990 --> 10:38.840
What's the matter, Nyarth?

10:38.840 --> 10:40.740
Did you have a nightmare or something?

10:41.020 --> 10:44.960
We and Squishy got chased by some strange flame ghost!

10:45.210 --> 10:48.860
Just be happy it was a dream. Don't wake us up at such strange hours.

10:49.130 --> 10:50.520
You're wrong!

10:50.520 --> 10:54.380
It was so realistic you'd think it <i>wasn't</i> a dream!

10:55.110 --> 10:57.150
That's right! Maybe Squishy...

11:04.230 --> 11:06.220
Hey, Pikachu!

11:06.920 --> 11:09.270
Squishy, where are you?

11:10.990 --> 11:12.600
I'm positive it was over here.

11:15.900 --> 11:20.380
In the dream just now, I ran into Pikachu around here...

11:29.320 --> 11:31.080
Pokémon Quiz...

11:31.080 --> 11:32.360
The answer is...?

11:50.830 --> 11:51.950
Pikachu?

11:52.390 --> 11:53.830
It's just like before...

11:55.160 --> 11:56.520
That means...

11:56.810 --> 11:58.470
...that thing will appear!

12:04.040 --> 12:05.450
I knew it!

12:06.550 --> 12:09.870
Is this a dream? Or is it real?

12:10.460 --> 12:11.620
Why you...!

12:11.620 --> 12:14.270
Where have you been?! We will run!

12:14.810 --> 12:16.750
Don't tell me that thing is going to appear again...!

12:17.150 --> 12:19.690
Obviously. We must hurry, or...

12:22.140 --> 12:23.900
Here it comes!

12:25.820 --> 12:26.860
Run!

12:27.080 --> 12:28.990
Let this be a dream too!

12:31.830 --> 12:33.610
Help!

12:43.130 --> 12:45.030
It's not coming after us.

12:46.250 --> 12:48.230
Seems like it gave up.

12:49.750 --> 12:52.650
Do not feel at ease yet! We command you, hurry and move to a safe place!

12:53.770 --> 12:55.750
It might catch up with us soon.

12:55.750 --> 12:57.580
You're a slave driver...

13:01.350 --> 13:02.500
What's this?

13:09.160 --> 13:12.330
This... Could the thing from earlier have done this?

13:12.840 --> 13:16.310
The lengths it will go in order to capture us...

13:37.660 --> 13:38.910
Wh-Wh-What?!

13:40.140 --> 13:41.980
Just who are you?!

13:41.980 --> 13:43.150
We are us.

13:43.150 --> 13:45.150
You're amazing!

13:45.400 --> 13:47.670
That is irrelevant! We must go!

13:49.850 --> 13:52.460
Once we pass through the forest we will be at our home very soon.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.680
All right!

14:03.630 --> 14:05.870
Those clouds look kinda ominous.

14:06.360 --> 14:09.500
Yes. There is no doubt that thing is approaching.

14:09.500 --> 14:10.140
We demand you to hurry!

14:10.380 --> 14:14.870
That's right! If you took on that scary form the next time that thing comes...

14:18.470 --> 14:20.950
...you wouldn't have any trouble handling it, would you?

14:21.290 --> 14:24.680
We cannot take on that form until we have returned home.

14:25.370 --> 14:29.950
Therefore, we only have to reach our home and those things will not assault us!

14:30.330 --> 14:31.610
Let's hurry, then!

14:39.130 --> 14:39.870
Stop, I demand!

14:39.870 --> 14:42.150
Wh-What's that?

14:43.270 --> 14:45.150
It got here first!

14:45.710 --> 14:47.690
It appears there is no choice but to fight.

14:48.350 --> 14:51.160
How are we supposed to fight that...

14:51.350 --> 14:53.620
...when we don't even know what it is?!

14:57.030 --> 14:58.230
Go, will you?!

14:58.830 --> 15:00.070
Don't push me!

15:09.420 --> 15:11.100
No, I'm not fine.

15:16.860 --> 15:17.400
I understand.

15:45.990 --> 15:46.970
Pikachu, my friend!

15:49.990 --> 15:51.720
Pardon our delay.

15:52.200 --> 15:54.280
Please leave the rest to us.

15:54.790 --> 15:56.740
They will have to get past us!

15:59.290 --> 16:01.690
Have a taste of this! Water Pulse!

16:03.580 --> 16:04.520
Flamethrower!

16:08.650 --> 16:10.330
Oh, not bad!

16:13.710 --> 16:14.710
Double Slap!

16:17.450 --> 16:19.120
This won't do...

16:22.600 --> 16:23.830
I've come to help out.

16:24.060 --> 16:26.700
No worries; you can leave this to me!

16:30.840 --> 16:32.540
Why did you...

16:32.540 --> 16:34.380
...take mine?!

16:34.950 --> 16:36.990
You've got plenty,

16:36.990 --> 16:40.060
so what's wrong with me taking a little bit? You cheapskate!

16:40.470 --> 16:42.380
Let's settle this with a battle!

16:42.380 --> 16:43.770
Bring it on!

16:45.910 --> 16:48.520
Huh? You <i>can't</i> evolve, Pikachu?

16:50.110 --> 16:51.230
It can't, it says.

16:51.230 --> 16:52.490
I see...

16:54.910 --> 16:55.660
Whoa!

16:56.510 --> 16:57.150
Oops!

16:58.680 --> 17:00.830
Let's fight <i>after </i>we beat up that thing.

17:01.080 --> 17:02.110
Yeah!

17:03.590 --> 17:05.540
Pin Missile!

17:06.410 --> 17:08.380
Dark Pulse!

17:15.740 --> 17:17.370
Good job, good job!

17:17.370 --> 17:19.070
That was not too bad!

17:19.070 --> 17:20.890
Keep it up!

17:32.060 --> 17:33.570
What's that sound?

17:55.950 --> 17:57.210
The place we were in before...?

17:59.310 --> 18:01.670
Does that mean we're back in reality?

18:04.710 --> 18:05.500
An explosion?

18:08.750 --> 18:10.250
What was that sound?

18:13.480 --> 18:15.100
Did you hear that "boom"?

18:16.010 --> 18:17.990
Was that your stomach, Musashi?

18:17.990 --> 18:20.070
That's the one thing it definitely <i>wasn't</i>!

18:20.070 --> 18:22.670
Musashi! Kojiro!

18:23.240 --> 18:25.560
Nyarth! Where have you been?

18:25.560 --> 18:27.710
It was terrible!

18:28.100 --> 18:30.310
First that flame ghost chases us,

18:30.310 --> 18:33.430
then the Pokémon start talking human language...

18:33.430 --> 18:36.170
...and as if that wasn't enough, they start evolving without warning!

18:36.540 --> 18:38.730
It was a complete chaos!

18:38.730 --> 18:42.730
Nyarth, you've been working too much recently. You must be tired.

18:42.730 --> 18:44.680
Why don't you go back to sleep?

18:44.680 --> 18:47.210
I don't want to!

18:47.390 --> 18:50.060
I don't want to dream again!

18:53.640 --> 18:56.380
So the sound came from your alarm clock, Citron.

18:56.590 --> 18:59.530
No way... So it was a failure...

18:59.870 --> 19:02.410
But this really <i>does</i> make sure you definitely wake up.

19:03.030 --> 19:04.380
I found Squishy!

19:08.440 --> 19:09.980
So this is where it was.

19:13.750 --> 19:16.650
Geez, don't just run off without letting us know.

19:20.190 --> 19:21.500
That's a Darkrai!

19:30.150 --> 19:31.470
Oh, Pikachu!

19:40.280 --> 19:44.430
Maybe it was Darkrai who was behind Pikachu's dream.

19:47.820 --> 19:49.450
What kind of dream was it?

20:00.190 --> 20:04.990
Due to Darkrai's influence, Pikachu and Nyarth entered Squishy's dream.

20:05.710 --> 20:09.160
Citron's invention managed to safely wake them up from the nightmare.

20:09.480 --> 20:13.150
And so, Satoshi and his friends continue their journey.

20:16.000 --> 20:21.010
Sunday November 29th at 8am!

20:16.540 --> 20:18.230
Pokénchiwa!

20:17.740 --> 20:18.780
It laughed!

20:18.780 --> 20:20.590
Pokénchi airs on Sundays at 8 AM!

20:23.550 --> 20:25.310
Pokémon Unbelievable!

20:26.380 --> 20:31.790
This is Pokémon Unbelievable, which features the mysterious ecology of Pokémon!

20:32.210 --> 20:37.180
Darkrai

20:32.280 --> 20:36.460
The Pitch-Black Pokémon Darkrai is another Pokémon that is full of mysteries.

20:36.890 --> 20:42.390
Darkrai is said to show nightmares to sleeping humans and Pokémon.

20:42.810 --> 20:46.190
However, there's a way to prevent those nightmares.

20:46.300 --> 20:48.790
Crecelia

20:46.380 --> 20:49.710
It's Crecelia's Lunar Wing.

20:48.790 --> 20:50.020
Lunar Wing

20:50.020 --> 20:53.960
Beware of imitations

20:50.270 --> 20:53.430
A Poppo feather won't work, so be careful!

21:04.750 --> 21:06.570
You wanna fight?!

21:07.020 --> 21:08.440
Bring it on!

21:12.790 --> 21:15.230
Everyone, beware of nightmares!

21:18.220 --> 21:20.140
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

21:20.310 --> 21:21.420
Towards our next adventure!

21:22.620 --> 21:25.670
Sanpei, I'll check how strong you've become!

21:25.950 --> 21:28.170
Yes! Please bear with me, Brother Nihei!

21:28.590 --> 21:29.720
Uh? What...!

21:31.130 --> 21:31.910
Brother Ippei!

21:32.350 --> 21:33.180
Those guys are...!

